1.
(a)  A scheduled bank, other
than a bank incorporated
by or under the laws of a
country outside India; or
(b)  a non-scheduled bank; or
(c)  a co-operative bank, other
than—
(i)  a primary agricultur
al credit society; or
(ii)  a primary co-opera
